import LOEIS.A302.A302500.Defs

set_option linter.unusedVariables false

/-!
# A302500

Lexicographically first sequence of distinct terms such that any set of five successive digits can be reordered as {d, d+1, d+2, d+3, d+4}, d being the smallest of the five digits.

The 62 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A302500

